0410E2 CD 36 19 04 0124*       call vdu_plot_bmp168
0410E6 C9          0125*       ret
0410E7             0126*   
0410E7             0127*   
0410E7             0128*   ; Load the bootstrap graphics while reporting one dot per finalized bitmap.
0410E7             0129*   ; outputs: canonical AGNB status in A/Z
0410E7             0130*   load_ui_images:
