041474             0176*   ; VDU 29, x; y;: Set graphics origin
041474             0177*   ; This command sets the graphics origin.
041474             0178*   ; The origin is the point on the screen where the coordinates (0,0) are located.
041474             0179*   ; inputs: bc=x0,de=y0
