046A0D             0459*   ; compute a sprite's new position based on its component x,y velocities
046A0D             0460*   ; with screen boundary checking and update its sprite table record accordingly
046A0D             0461*   ; inputs: table_pointer set to sprite record
046A0D             0462*   ; returns: updated x, y positions and edge collision flags in sprite_screen_edge
046A0D             0463*   ; destroys: everything
